<title>GREECE: Greek shipper Strintzis 1996 turnover up 15.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek shipper Strintzis 1996 turnover up 15.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek passenger shipper Strintzis Lines said in a statement that its 1996 turnover rose 15.9 percent to 21.14 billion drachmas from 18.24 billion in 1995.</p>
</text>
